  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, whisk together flour, water, soy sauce, sake, rice vinegar, sugar, salt, and black pepper to make the batter.",
    "Add the shredded cabbage to the bowl and toss to coat with the batter.",
    "Heat a 10-inch non-stick skillet or okonomiyaki pan over medium heat.",
    "Brush the skillet with cooking oil and add the batter and cabbage mixture.",
    "Cook for 2-3 minutes or until the bottom is golden brown.",
    "Loosen the edges of the okonomiyaki with a spatula and flip it over.",
    "Cook for an additional 2-3 minutes or until the other side is also golden brown.",
    "Transfer the okonomiyaki to a serving plate and brush with wholegrain mustard.",
    "Top with chopped green onions and serve immediately."
  ],
